{
  "id": "6aa08662ea6c4150eba10180",
  "title": "PCから出るファンの音が気になる",
  "created": 1788905060,
  "updated": 1789004808,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aa08662ea6c4150eba10180",
      "text": "PCから出るファンの音が気になる",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1788905060,
      "updated": 1788905061
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa086640000000000ef702e",
      "text": "気になる[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1788905061,
      "updated": 1788905069
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa086650000000000ef7030",
      "text": "気にならない[Hiro Aki.icon][koyoshi.icon][bsahd.icon][Aria.icon]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788905062,
      "updated": 1789004808
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa086670000000000ef7031",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1788905063,
      "updated": 1788905067
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa086700000000000ef7035",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1788905072,
      "updated": 1788905072
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa0866d0000000000ef7032",
      "text": "[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1788905070,
      "updated": 1788905070
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa0866e0000000000ef7034",
      "text": "\t気になる",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1788905070,
      "updated": 1788905072
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa086710000000000ef7036",
      "text": "\t無音であってほしい",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1788905073,
      "updated": 1788905088
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa09d6e00000000006648df",
      "text": "\tたしかに、発生理由が気になる、はとてもわかる",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1788910958,
      "updated": 1788910965
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa086850000000000ef7037",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1788905094,
      "updated": 1788905101
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa09a5f000000000097c470",
      "text": "[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1788910176,
      "updated": 1788910177
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa09a61000000000097c472",
      "text": "\t気になるけど程度による",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1788910177,
      "updated": 1788910195
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa09a73000000000097c473",
      "text": "\t無音が理想ではあるが、音が出るということは負荷がかかってると分かるわけで、意図的に負荷を掛けていないのに音が出るということは何か問題か知らない間に処理が発生しているわけで必要と思う",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1788910195,
      "updated": 1788910316
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa09ac3000000000097c475",
      "text": "\tなので細かく表現すると、音自体に対して気にならないが、音の発生理由については気になる感じ",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1788910275,
      "updated": 1788910302
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa09a61000000000097c471",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1788910177,
      "updated": 1788910177
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa0ab8c0000000000fa53ce",
      "text": "[koyoshi.icon]",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1788914573,
      "updated": 1788914574
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa0ab8e0000000000fa53d0",
      "text": " 音自体は気にならないけど、音の変化は気になる",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1788914575,
      "updated": 1788914598
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa0abaa0000000000fa53d1",
      "text": "  急に大きくなったり、止まったり",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1788914602,
      "updated": 1788914614
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa0ab8e0000000000fa53cf",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1788914574,
      "updated": 1788914574
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa2090e0000000000d35d7d",
      "text": "[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789004045,
      "updated": 1789004047
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa209110000000000d35d7f",
      "text": " いつもより大きいと気になる",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789004047,
      "updated": 1789004055
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa209100000000000d35d7e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789004047,
      "updated": 1789004047
    }
  ]
}